# Ignore everything, then re-include only what the image needs.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!db/
# The coordinator rejoin (src/restaurantos/coordinator/rejoin.py) reads this
# script at runtime and mounts it into the recovery Compose run.
!infra/postgres/rejoin-node.sh
# Re-included folders still must not bring junk in.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
